        "id": "p1",
        "heading": "Ask the meaning first",
        "body": "Central idea: A good verb choice tells readers how the action fits in the story.\n\nExplore: Ask: Did it finish at a closed time? Does it matter now? Is it background or a habit? «Leía cuando llamaron» has background and a finished event.\n\nPractice: Write three short stories and choose the form that fits each one. Explain one choice.\n\nCommon mistake: Do not ignore time clues such as ayer, ya, and cuando."
      }
    ],
